Rendered-markdown links (notifications, settings descriptions, debug console,
tree/list rows) activate on plain click, but inside a Gesture target the
touchstart is preventDefaulted and the browser never synthesizes one - links
were tap-dead on touch. Register the rendered block as a Gesture target and
activate links on Tap.

